  "assertions": {
    "seed": [
      "The real native backend is initialized by privileged synthetic fixture seeding, not authenticated funding or live READY.",
      "The V4 owned backend sequential runner retains the first original and dispatch intent before its declared bodyless request reaches the existing durable backend session.",
      "One synthetic backend callback returns success and the backend commits SUCCEEDED; the declared transport then loses the response.",
      "The runner rejects RUN_FAILED, records exactly one attempted entry, drops its unattempted queued tail and persists one selected-grant CUSTODY_OUTCOME_UNKNOWN marker.",
      "The owned payer native store close returns once, releases its slot and leaves the actual cached root close Promise rejecting CHILD_OUTCOME_UNKNOWN. The durable session and borrowed backend store are then closed before the seed process exits.",
      "The bounded witness records full file byte/identity pins, non-epoch logical-row/schema digests, the exact original request and its synthetic public proof. The private test key is not exported or serialized."
    ],
    "freshRecovery": [
      "Before any repository or native SQLite import, the fresh process verifies both file byte/content/identity pins against the seed witness and uses a different process ID.",
      "The actual backend openExisting path validates the same ledger; its retained original and durable execution remain SUCCEEDED.",
      "The actual openServiceCreditCustodiedSqliteBackendRecoveryClientV4 exposes only six recovery/snapshot/close operations, with no submit, batch, store, root, sign, pay or caller-transport capability.",
      "The exact original caller-supplied public proof is reused through real capability admission and the exact-original native backend query. It is not regenerated.",
      "The result is CLIENT_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED with nested CACHED_SUCCESS. Funding remains BOUND revision 3, the original request remains exact, dispatch remains POSSIBLY_ATTEMPTED and custody uncertainty remains true.",
      "All action, payment, signing and delivery flags remain false; NONE authority and NOT_ESTABLISHED delivery persist.",
      "The backend original query is non-mutating; the fresh process performs no HTTP request, execution callback, deadline scheduling, keypair generation, proof generation or quarantine rewrite.",
      "The owned payer close again returns its one native DB close but the actual cached root Promise remains UNKNOWN. Combined backend reads are synchronously closed.",
      "All payer non-epoch logical rows and schema match the seed digest exactly; only owner_epoch advances 2 to 3. All backend rows, schema and full file bytes remain unchanged."
    ]
  },
